{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_c22664ff5a1c4110b7c383c9","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n## Comprehensive Report on D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/\n\n### 1. File Structure\n\nThe project contains 37 files, organized as follows:\n\n**Configuration Files:**\n- `GDD.md` - Game Design Document in Chinese\n- `game.json` - Game configuration (portrait orientation, permissions)\n- `package.json` - Node.js package configuration\n- `project.config.json` - Developer tool configuration\n- `build.py` - Build script\n- `privacy-policy.html` - Privacy policy\n\n**Source Code (src/js):**\n- Core game: Game.js, Board.js, MatchEngine.js, Animation.js\n- Input: InputHandler.js\n- Rendering: Renderer.js\n- Systems: ScoreSystem.js, DataManager.js, CoinSystem.js\n- Characters: Characters.js\n- UI: Navigation.js, MapScreen.js, ShopUI.js\n- Obstacles: Obstacle.js, Boss.js\n- Levels: levels.js\n- Audio: AudioManager.js\n- Social: SocialSystem.js\n- Daily: DailySystem.js\n- Analytics: Analytics.js\n- Ads: AdManager.js, ad-config.js\n\n**Build Output (dist/):** Complete copy of src/ with built assets\n\n### 2. GDD.md - Game Design Document\n\nThe game is \"消消消大作战\" (Match & Blast), a match-3 puzzle game for Douyin (TikTok) mini-games:\n\n**Key Features:**\n- 8×8 grid with 6 colored fruit tiles\n- Swap adjacent tiles to match 3+ in a row/column\n- Special tiles: striped bombs, area bombs, rainbow tiles\n- Obstacles: ice, chains, chocolate, locked boxes\n- Boss levels where matches damage the boss\n- 50 planned levels with increasing difficulty\n- Meta-progression: map screen, characters, coins\n- Daily system: login rewards, daily challenges\n- Social features: friend leaderboard, PK, sharing\n- Monetization: rewarded video ads, interstitial ads\n\n**Platform:** Douyin/TikTok mini-games with web fallback\n**Package Size:** Target < 4MB\n**Monetization:** IAA (In-App Advertising) focused\n\n### 3. Main Game Source Files\n\n**Entry Point:**\n- `index.html` - Main HTML with canvas element\n- `Game.js` - Main game controller and state machine\n- `game.json` - Configuration for orientation and permissions\n\n**Core Game Loop:**\nThe main game loop in `Game.js` manages:\n- State machine: MENU → IDLE → SWAPPING → MATCHING → REMOVING → DROPPING → RESULT\n- Board management through `Board.js`\n- Match detection via `MatchEngine.js`\n- Animation system with `Animation.js`\n- Score and level progression\n- Character skills and meta-progression\n\n### 4. Input Event Handling\n\n**Primary Handler: `InputHandler.js`**\n- Handles both mouse and touch events\n- Detects swipe gestures for tile swapping\n- Minimum swipe distance threshold (20% of tile size)\n- Coordinates conversion from screen to grid positions\n- Prevents input during game states (swapping, matching, etc.)\n\n**Additional Input Handling:**\n- `Navigation.js` - Handles clicks on UI screens (menu, map, shop, etc.)\n- Individual UI components have their own click handlers:\n  - `MapScreen.js` - Map navigation and level selection\n  - `ShopUI.js` - Shop interactions\n  - `DailySystem.js` - Daily task clicks\n  - `SocialSystem.js` - Social feature clicks\n\n### 5. Douyin/TikTok API Integration (tt.*)\n\n**Social System (`SocialSystem.js`):**\n```javascript\n// Share results\ntt.shareAppMessage({\n  title: `我在消消消大作战第${levelId}关获得了${stars}星！来挑战我吧`,\n  query: `from=share&level=${levelId}&inviter=${this.getUserId()}`,\n});\n\n// Check if running in Douyin environment\nthis.isDouyin = typeof tt !== 'undefined';\n```\n\n**Ad Manager (`AdManager.js`):**\n```javascript\n// Rewarded video ads\nthis.rewardedAd = tt.createRewardedVideoAd({\n  adUnitId: 'adunit-xxx'\n});\n\n// Interstitial ads\nthis.interstitialAd = tt.createInterstitialAd({\n  adUnitId: 'adunit-yyy'\n});\n\n// Analytics upload\ntt.request || fetch({\n  url: 'https://analytics.example.com/events',\n  method: 'POST',\n  data: { events, appId: 'match-and-blast' }\n});\n```\n\n**Analytics (`Analytics.js`):**\n- Batch analytics events for server upload\n- Detects Douyin environment for real analytics\n- Fallback to console logging in web mode\n\n### 6. Canvas Resize and Screen Adaptation\n\n**Renderer.js:**\n```javascript\nresize() {\n  const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n  const w = window.innerWidth;\n  const h = window.innerHeight;\n  \n  // Set canvas dimensions\n  this.canvas.width = w * dpr;\n  this.canvas.height = h * dpr;\n  this.canvas.style.width = w + 'px';\n  this.canvas.style.height = h + 'px';\n  \n  // Scale for high-DPI displays\n  this.ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n  \n  // Calculate responsive tile size\n  this.tileSize = Math.floor(Math.min(w * 0.9, (h - 160)) / BOARD_SIZE);\n  this.boardX = (w - this.tileSize * BOARD_SIZE) / 2;\n  this.boardY = 140;\n}\n```\n\n**Adaptive Layout Features:**\n- All UI elements use relative positioning (screenW/screenH)\n- Tile sizes scale based on screen dimensions\n- Maintains 8×8 grid aspect ratio\n- Board is centered with padding\n- UI bars and buttons resize proportionally\n- Text scales appropriately for different screen sizes\n\n**Resize Handling in index.html:**\n```javascript\nfunction onResize() {\n  game.renderer.resize();\n  game.input.updateLayout(\n    game.renderer.tileSize,\n    game.renderer.boardX,\n    game.renderer.boardY,\n  );\n}\n\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', onResize);\nwindow.addEventListener('orientationchange', () => setTimeout(onResize, 100));\n```\n\n### Key Technical Observations:\n\n1. **Platform Abstraction:** The game uses `typeof tt !== 'undefined'` to detect Douyin environment and falls back to web mode for development.\n\n2. **Input Handling:** Comprehensive touch/mouse support with swipe detection and coordinate transformation.\n\n3. **Responsive Design:** Canvas-based rendering with dynamic scaling for different screen sizes.\n\n4. **API Integration:** Extensive use of Douyin APIs for sharing, ads, and analytics with stub implementations for web fallback.\n\n5. **State Management:** Clean separation of game logic, rendering, input handling, and UI navigation.\n\n6. **Monetization Strategy:** Multiple ad placements with frequency limits and user-friendly UI design.\n\nThe game is well-structured for both Douyin mini-game deployment and web-based development, with comprehensive features including meta-progression, social elements, and advertising integration."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33562fd9-d4f0-45be-a2a4-d9d379182d9f","uuid":"ba5afe74-cd29-43f2-992f-911f22fca0f1","timestamp":"2026-05-23T10:14:46.428Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the directory D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/ and report:\n1. List all files in the project (use Glob pattern **/*)\n2. Read GDD.md if it exists\n3. Read the main game source files (look for .js, .ts, or .json entry points)\n4. Identify all files that handle input events (click, touch, mouse, pointer)\n5. Identify all files that reference tt.* APIs (Douyin/TikTok mini-game APIs)\n6. Identify canvas resize / screen adaptation code\n\nReport everything you find. Be thorough - read the actual source code content.","agentId":"acf1e056afe9ec0b7","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n## Comprehensive Report on D:/game-projects/douyin-match3/\n\n### 1. File Structure\n\nThe project contains 37 files, organized as follows:\n\n**Configuration Files:**\n- `GDD.md` - Game Design Document in Chinese\n- `game.json` - Game configuration (portrait orientation, permissions)\n- `package.json` - Node.js package configuration\n- `project.config.json` - Developer tool configuration\n- `build.py` - Build script\n- `privacy-policy.html` - Privacy policy\n\n**Source Code (src/js):**\n- Core game: Game.js, Board.js, MatchEngine.js, Animation.js\n- Input: InputHandler.js\n- Rendering: Renderer.js\n- Systems: ScoreSystem.js, DataManager.js, CoinSystem.js\n- Characters: Characters.js\n- UI: Navigation.js, MapScreen.js, ShopUI.js\n- Obstacles: Obstacle.js, Boss.js\n- Levels: levels.js\n- Audio: AudioManager.js\n- Social: SocialSystem.js\n- Daily: DailySystem.js\n- Analytics: Analytics.js\n- Ads: AdManager.js, ad-config.js\n\n**Build Output (dist/):** Complete copy of src/ with built assets\n\n### 2. GDD.md - Game Design Document\n\nThe game is \"消消消大作战\" (Match & Blast), a match-3 puzzle game for Douyin (TikTok) mini-games:\n\n**Key Features:**\n- 8×8 grid with 6 colored fruit tiles\n- Swap adjacent tiles to match 3+ in a row/column\n- Special tiles: striped bombs, area bombs, rainbow tiles\n- Obstacles: ice, chains, chocolate, locked boxes\n- Boss levels where matches damage the boss\n- 50 planned levels with increasing difficulty\n- Meta-progression: map screen, characters, coins\n- Daily system: login rewards, daily challenges\n- Social features: friend leaderboard, PK, sharing\n- Monetization: rewarded video ads, interstitial ads\n\n**Platform:** Douyin/TikTok mini-games with web fallback\n**Package Size:** Target < 4MB\n**Monetization:** IAA (In-App Advertising) focused\n\n### 3. Main Game Source Files\n\n**Entry Point:**\n- `index.html` - Main HTML with canvas element\n- `Game.js` - Main game controller and state machine\n- `game.json` - Configuration for orientation and permissions\n\n**Core Game Loop:**\nThe main game loop in `Game.js` manages:\n- State machine: MENU → IDLE → SWAPPING → MATCHING → REMOVING → DROPPING → RESULT\n- Board management through `Board.js`\n- Match detection via `MatchEngine.js`\n- Animation system with `Animation.js`\n- Score and level progression\n- Character skills and meta-progression\n\n### 4. Input Event Handling\n\n**Primary Handler: `InputHandler.js`**\n- Handles both mouse and touch events\n- Detects swipe gestures for tile swapping\n- Minimum swipe distance threshold (20% of tile size)\n- Coordinates conversion from screen to grid positions\n- Prevents input during game states (swapping, matching, etc.)\n\n**Additional Input Handling:**\n- `Navigation.js` - Handles clicks on UI screens (menu, map, shop, etc.)\n- Individual UI components have their own click handlers:\n  - `MapScreen.js` - Map navigation and level selection\n  - `ShopUI.js` - Shop interactions\n  - `DailySystem.js` - Daily task clicks\n  - `SocialSystem.js` - Social feature clicks\n\n### 5. Douyin/TikTok API Integration (tt.*)\n\n**Social System (`SocialSystem.js`):**\n```javascript\n// Share results\ntt.shareAppMessage({\n  title: `我在消消消大作战第${levelId}关获得了${stars}星！来挑战我吧`,\n  query: `from=share&level=${levelId}&inviter=${this.getUserId()}`,\n});\n\n// Check if running in Douyin environment\nthis.isDouyin = typeof tt !== 'undefined';\n```\n\n**Ad Manager (`AdManager.js`):**\n```javascript\n// Rewarded video ads\nthis.rewardedAd = tt.createRewardedVideoAd({\n  adUnitId: 'adunit-xxx'\n});\n\n// Interstitial ads\nthis.interstitialAd = tt.createInterstitialAd({\n  adUnitId: 'adunit-yyy'\n});\n\n// Analytics upload\ntt.request || fetch({\n  url: 'https://analytics.example.com/events',\n  method: 'POST',\n  data: { events, appId: 'match-and-blast' }\n});\n```\n\n**Analytics (`Analytics.js`):**\n- Batch analytics events for server upload\n- Detects Douyin environment for real analytics\n- Fallback to console logging in web mode\n\n### 6. Canvas Resize and Screen Adaptation\n\n**Renderer.js:**\n```javascript\nresize() {\n  const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n  const w = window.innerWidth;\n  const h = window.innerHeight;\n  \n  // Set canvas dimensions\n  this.canvas.width = w * dpr;\n  this.canvas.height = h * dpr;\n  this.canvas.style.width = w + 'px';\n  this.canvas.style.height = h + 'px';\n  \n  // Scale for high-DPI displays\n  this.ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n  \n  // Calculate responsive tile size\n  this.tileSize = Math.floor(Math.min(w * 0.9, (h - 160)) / BOARD_SIZE);\n  this.boardX = (w - this.tileSize * BOARD_SIZE) / 2;\n  this.boardY = 140;\n}\n```\n\n**Adaptive Layout Features:**\n- All UI elements use relative positioning (screenW/screenH)\n- Tile sizes scale based on screen dimensions\n- Maintains 8×8 grid aspect ratio\n- Board is centered with padding\n- UI bars and buttons resize proportionally\n- Text scales appropriately for different screen sizes\n\n**Resize Handling in index.html:**\n```javascript\nfunction onResize() {\n  game.renderer.resize();\n  game.input.updateLayout(\n    game.renderer.tileSize,\n    game.renderer.boardX,\n    game.renderer.boardY,\n  );\n}\n\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', onResize);\nwindow.addEventListener('orientationchange', () => setTimeout(onResize, 100));\n```\n\n### Key Technical Observations:\n\n1. **Platform Abstraction:** The game uses `typeof tt !== 'undefined'` to detect Douyin environment and falls back to web mode for development.\n\n2. **Input Handling:** Comprehensive touch/mouse support with swipe detection and coordinate transformation.\n\n3. **Responsive Design:** Canvas-based rendering with dynamic scaling for different screen sizes.\n\n4. **API Integration:** Extensive use of Douyin APIs for sharing, ads, and analytics with stub implementations for web fallback.\n\n5. **State Management:** Clean separation of game logic, rendering, input handling, and UI navigation.\n\n6. **Monetization Strategy:** Multiple ad placements with frequency limits and user-friendly UI design.\n\nThe game is well-structured for both Douyin mini-game deployment and web-based development, with comprehensive features including meta-progression, social elements, and advertising integration."}],"totalDurationMs":204842,"totalTokens":112272,"totalToolUseCount":14,"usage":{"input_tokens":11851,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":98070,"output_tokens":2351,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":10,"searchCount":4,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
