{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_0b3499d3525a462cb4638eae","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t/* 成语大闯关 — 国风主题 */\n2\t\n3\t* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }\n4\t\n5\tbody {\n6\t  font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'SimSun', serif;\n7\t  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F5F0E8 0%, #E8DED0 100%);\n8\t  min-height: 100vh;\n9\t  overflow: hidden;\n10\t  color: #2C2C2C;\n11\t}\n12\t\n13\t#app {\n14\t  width: 100%; height: 100vh;\n15\t  max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto;\n16\t  position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n17\t}\n18\t\n19\t.screen {\n20\t  display: none; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n21\t  flex-direction: column; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;\n22\t}\n23\t.screen.active { display: flex; }\n24\t\n25\t/* ===== 主菜单 ===== */\n26\t.menu-bg {\n27\t  flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n28\t  align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 20px;\n29\t  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFDF7 0%, #F5F0E8 50%, #E8DED0 100%);\n30\t}\n31\t\n32\t.title-block { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n33\t.title {\n34\t  font-size: 42px; font-weight: 900; color: #C84B31;\n35\t  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #D4A843, 4px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n36\t  letter-spacing: 8px;\n37\t}\n38\t.subtitle { font-size: 16px; color: #8B7355; margin-top: 8px; letter-spacing: 4px; }\n39\t\n40\t.menu-stats {\n41\t  display: flex; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 40px;\n42\t  font-size: 16px; color: #8B7355;\n43\t}\n44\t.stat-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n45\t\n46\t.menu-buttons { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; width: 240px; }\n47\t.menu-footer { margin-top: 40px; display: flex; gap: 16px; }\n48\t.btn-icon {\n49\t  width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 2px solid #D4A843;\n50\t  border-radius: 50%; background: #FFFDF7; font-size: 20px;\n51\t  cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n52\t}\n53\t.btn-icon:active { background: #F5F0E8; }\n54\t\n55\t/* ===== 按钮 ===== */\n56\t.btn {\n57\t  padding: 14px 28px; border: none; border-radius: 24px;\n58\t  font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\n59\t  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n60\t  letter-spacing: 2px;\n61\t}\n62\t.btn:active { transform: scale(0.95); }\n63\t.btn-primary {\n64\t  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C84B31, #A63A22);\n65\t  color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(200,75,49,0.3);\n66\t}\n67\t.btn-secondary {\n68\t  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D6A4F, #1E4D33);\n69\t  color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(45,106,79,0.3);\n70\t}\n71\t.btn-accent {\n72\t  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A843, #B8922E);\n73\t  color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(212,168,67,0.3);\n74\t}\n75\t\n76\t.btn-back {\n77\t  background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px;\n78\t  cursor: pointer; padding: 8px; color: #8B7355;\n79\t}\n80\t\n81\t/* ===== 关卡地图 ===== */\n82\t.map-header {\n83\t  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n84\t  padding: 12px 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);\n85\t  border-bottom: 1px solid #E8DED0;\n86\t}\n87\t.map-header h2 { font-size: 18px; color: #C84B31; }\n88\t\n89\t.chapter-info { padding: 8px 16px; }\n90\t.chapter-badge {\n91\t  display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;\n92\t  font-size: 13px; color: #2C2C2C; margin-right: 8px;\n93\t}\n94\t\n95\t.level-grid {\n96\t  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px;\n97\t  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n98\t}\n99\t\n100\t.chapter-section {\n101\t  margin-bottom: 16px; padding: 12px;\n102\t  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); border-radius: 16px;\n103\t  border-left: 4px solid #D4A843;\n104\t  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: center;\n105\t}\n106\t\n107\t.level-btn {\n108\t  width: 70px; padding: 8px 4px; border: 2px solid #E8DED0;\n109\t  border-radius: 12px; background: #FFFDF7; cursor: pointer;\n110\t  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\n111\t  gap: 2px; transition: transform 0.1s;\n112\t}\n113\t.level-btn:active { transform: scale(0.95); }\n114\t.level-btn.locked { opacity: 0.5; pointer-events: none; }\n115\t.level-btn.completed { border-color: #27AE60; }\n116\t.level-btn.boss {\n117\t  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF5E0, #FFE0B2);\n118\t  border-color: #D4A843;\n119\t}\n120\t.level-num { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #C84B31; }\n121\t.level-stars { font-size: 10px; color: #D4A843; }\n122\t.level-name { font-size: 9px; color: #8B7355; }\n123\t.level-btn.locked .level-num { color: #ccc; }\n124\t\n125\t/* ===== 游戏界面 ===== */\n126\t.game-header {\n127\t  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n128\t  padding: 8px 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);\n129\t  border-bottom: 1px solid #E8DED0;\n130\t}\n131\t.header-center { display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n132\t.header-right { font-size: 14px; }\n133\t\n134\t.game-body {\n135\t  flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n136\t  align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n137\t  padding: 12px 16px; gap: 16px; overflow: hidden;\n138\t}\n139\t\n140\t.combo-display {\n141\t  font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4A843;\n142\t  text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(212,168,67,0.5);\n143\t  display: none; animation: comboPopIn 0.3s ease-out;\n144\t}\n145\t.combo-3, .combo-4 { color: #D4A843; }\n146\t.combo-5, .combo-6, .combo-7 { color: #FF8C00; font-size: 24px; }\n147\t.combo-8, .combo-9 { color: #FF6347; font-size: 28px; }\n148\t.combo-10 { color: #FF4500; font-size: 32px; animation: comboShake 0.3s ease-out; }\n149\t\n150\t@keyframes comboPopIn {\n151\t  0% { transform: scale(0.5); opacity: 0; }\n152\t  100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n153\t}\n154\t@keyframes comboShake {\n155\t  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n156\t  25% { transform: translateX(-5px); }\n157\t  75% { transform: translateX(5px); }\n158\t}\n159\t\n160\t.meaning-box {\n161\t  background: #FFFDF7; border: 2px solid #E8DED0;\n162\t  border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 20px;\n163\t  text-align: center; max-width: 90%; min-height: 50px;\n164\t  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n165\t}\n166\t#meaning-text { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2C2C2C; }\n167\t\n168\t.slots-container {\n169\t  display: flex; gap: 10px; margin: 8px 0;\n170\t}\n171\t\n172\t.slot {\n173\t  width: 60px; height: 60px;\n174\t  border: 3px solid #8B7355; border-radius: 10px;\n175\t  background: #FFFDF7; display: flex;\n176\t  align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n177\t  font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #2C2C2C;\n178\t  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;\n179\t  position: relative;\n180\t}\n181\t.slot.filled { background: #FFF8E8; border-color: #C84B31; }\n182\t.slot.correct {\n183\t  background: #27AE60; border-color: #27AE60; color: white;\n184\t  animation: correctPulse 0.4s;\n185\t}\n186\t.slot.wrong {\n187\t  background: #E74C3C; border-color: #E74C3C; color: white;\n188\t  animation: wrongShake 0.5s;\n189\t}\n190\t\n191\t@keyframes correctPulse {\n192\t  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }\n193\t  50% { transform: scale(1.12); }\n194\t}\n195\t@keyframes wrongShake {\n196\t  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n197\t  25% { transform: translateX(-8px); }\n198\t  75% { transform: translateX(8px); }\n199\t}\n200\t\n201\t.idiom-hint {\n202\t  font-size: 13px; color: #8B7355; text-align: center;\n203\t  padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\n204\t  border-radius: 8px; display: none; max-width: 90%;\n205\t}\n206\t.idiom-hint strong { color: #C84B31; }\n207\t\n208\t.candidates-container {\n209\t  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;\n210\t  justify-content: center; max-width: 340px; margin-top: 8px;\n211\t}\n212\t\n213\t.candidate {\n214\t  width: 48px; height: 48px; border: none; border-radius: 10px;\n215\t  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C84B31, #A63A22);\n216\t  color: white; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold;\n217\t  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;\n218\t  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n219\t}\n220\t.candidate:active { transform: scale(0.9); }\n221\t.candidate.used {\n222\t  opacity: 0.25; pointer-events: none; transform: scale(0.9);\n223\t}\n224\t.candidate.removed {\n225\t  opacity: 0.1; pointer-events: none;\n226\t}\n227\t\n228\t.game-footer {\n229\t  display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px;\n230\t  padding: 12px 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);\n231\t  border-top: 1px solid #E8DED0;\n232\t}\n233\t\n234\t.tool-btn {\n235\t  padding: 8px 16px; border: 2px solid #2D6A4F;\n236\t  border-radius: 20px; background: white;\n237\t  color: #2D6A4F; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;\n238\t  transition: all 0.15s;\n239\t}\n240\t.tool-btn:active { background: #2D6A4F; color: white; }\n241\t\n242\t/* ===== 教学覆盖层 ===== */\n243\t.tutorial-overlay {\n244\t  position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n245\t  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); padding: 20px;\n246\t  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n247\t  z-index: 100;\n248\t}\n249\t.tutorial-text {\n250\t  color: white; font-size: 16px; text-align: center;\n251\t  line-height: 1.5; max-width: 80%;\n252\t}\n253\t\n254\t/* ===== 结算界面 ===== */\n255\t.result-card {\n256\t  flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n257\t  align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n258\t  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFDF7, #F5F0E8);\n259\t  padding: 40px 20px;\n260\t}\n261\t\n262\t.result-title {\n263\t  font-size: 36px; color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 16px;\n264\t}\n265\t\n266\t.result-stars {\n267\t  font-size: 40px; color: #D4A843; margin-bottom: 20px;\n268\t  display: flex; gap: 8px;\n269\t}\n270\t\n271\t.result-stats {\n272\t  text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 2;\n273\t  font-size: 16px;\n274\t}\n275\t.coins-earned {\n276\t  font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #D4A843;\n277\t  margin-top: 8px;\n278\t}\n279\t\n280\t.result-buttons {\n281\t  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; width: 220px;\n282\t}\n283\t\n284\t/* ===== 模态框 ===== */\n285\t.modal {\n286\t  position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n287\t  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); display: flex;\n288\t  align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 200;\n289\t}\n290\t.modal-content {\n291\t  background: #FFFDF7; border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px;\n292\t  text-align: center; max-width: 320px; width: 90%;\n293\t}\n294\t.modal-content h3 { font-size: 22px; color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n295\t.modal-content p { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #8B7355; }\n296\t.modal-buttons { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }\n297\t\n298\t/* ===== W2: 通用 ===== */\n299\t.btn-outline {\n300\t  padding: 10px 16px; border: 2px solid #D4A843; border-radius: 20px;\n301\t  background: transparent; color: #8B7355; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;\n302\t  transition: all 0.15s;\n303\t}\n304\t.btn-outline:active { background: #FFF8E8; }\n305\t.btn-sm { padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 14px; }\n306\t\n307\t.menu-row {\n308\t  display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\n309\t}\n310\t\n311\t/* ===== W2: 计时器 ===== */\n312\t.timer-display {\n313\t  font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #C84B31;\n314\t  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n315\t}\n316\t.timer-warning { color: #E74C3C; animation: timerPulse 0.5s infinite; }\n317\t@keyframes timerPulse {\n318\t  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n319\t  50% { opacity: 0.5; }\n320\t}\n321\t\n322\t/* ===== W2: 成语图鉴 ===== */\n323\t.col-bar-wrap { padding: 8px 16px; }\n324\t.col-bar {\n325\t  height: 8px; background: #E8DED0; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\n326\t}\n327\t.col-bar-fill {\n328\t  height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2D6A4F, #27AE60);\n329\t  border-radius: 4px; transition: width 0.3s;\n330\t}\n331\t.col-search {\n332\t  display: block; width: calc(100% - 32px); margin: 8px 16px;\n333\t  padding: 10px 14px; border: 2px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 12px;\n334\t  font-size: 14px; background: #FFFDF7; outline: none;\n335\t}\n336\t.col-search:focus { border-color: #C84B31; }\n337\t.col-categories {\n338\t  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 16px 8px;\n339\t  overflow-x: auto;\n340\t}\n341\t.cat-btn {\n342\t  padding: 4px 12px; border: 1px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 14px;\n343\t  background: #FFFDF7; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;\n344\t  color: #8B7355;\n345\t}\n346\t.cat-btn.active { background: #C84B31; color: white; border-color: #C84B31; }\n347\t.col-grid {\n348\t  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 8px 16px;\n349\t  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(80px, 1fr));\n350\t  gap: 8px; align-content: start;\n351\t}\n352\t.idiom-card {\n353\t  background: #FFFDF7; border: 2px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 10px;\n354\t  padding: 8px 4px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer;\n355\t  transition: all 0.15s;\n356\t}\n357\t.idiom-card.collected { border-color: #2D6A4F; background: #F0FFF4; }\n358\t.idiom-card:active { transform: scale(0.95); }\n359\t.idiom-text { display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #2C2C2C; }\n360\t.idiom-card:not(.collected) .idiom-text { color: #ccc; }\n361\t.idiom-cat { display: block; font-size: 10px; color: #8B7355; margin-top: 2px; }\n362\t.more-hint {\n363\t  grid-column: 1 / -1; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;\n364\t  color: #8B7355; padding: 8px;\n365\t}\n366\t.col-detail {\n367\t  position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n368\t  background: #FFFDF7; border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0; padding: 20px;\n369\t  box-shadow: 0 -4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); max-height: 60vh; overflow-y: auto;\n370\t  z-index: 50;\n371\t}\n372\t.detail-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n373\t.detail-header h3 { font-size: 24px; color: #C84B31; }\n374\t.detail-pinyin { color: #8B7355; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n375\t.detail-meaning { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n376\t.detail-origin { font-size: 13px; color: #8B7355; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n377\t.detail-example { font-size: 13px; color: #2D6A4F; font-style: italic; }\n378\t.detail-locked { color: #8B7355; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }\n379\t\n380\t/* ===== W2: 每日系统 ===== */\n381\t.daily-content { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px; }\n382\t.daily-login {\n383\t  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF8E8, #F5F0E8);\n384\t  border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 16px;\n385\t  border: 2px solid #D4A843;\n386\t}\n387\t.daily-login h3 { color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n388\t.streak-num { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4A843; }\n389\t.daily-section { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n390\t.daily-section h3 { font-size: 16px; color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n391\t.task-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }\n392\t.task-item {\n393\t  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n394\t  background: #FFFDF7; border: 1px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 12px;\n395\t  padding: 10px 14px;\n396\t}\n397\t.task-item.done { opacity: 0.6; }\n398\t.task-desc { font-size: 14px; flex: 1; }\n399\t.task-progress { font-size: 13px; color: #8B7355; margin: 0 8px; }\n400\t.task-btn {\n401\t  padding: 4px 12px; border: 1px solid #2D6A4F; border-radius: 12px;\n402\t  background: white; color: #2D6A4F; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;\n403\t}\n404\t.task-btn.claimed { background: #F0F0F0; color: #999; border-color: #ddd; }\n405\t.task-btn:disabled { cursor: default; }\n406\t.challenge-card {\n407\t  background: #FFFDF7; border: 2px solid #D4A843; border-radius: 16px;\n408\t  padding: 16px; text-align: center;\n409\t}\n410\t.challenge-card.done { border-color: #2D6A4F; background: #F0FFF4; }\n411\t.challenge-card h4 { color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n412\t.challenge-meaning { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n413\t.challenge-hint { font-size: 14px; color: #8B7355; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n414\t.challenge-done { color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: bold; }\n415\t\n416\t/* ===== W2: PK ===== */\n417\t.pk-answers { margin: 12px 0; text-align: left; max-width: 280px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }\n418\t.answer-item {\n419\t  padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px;\n420\t  font-size: 14px;\n421\t}\n422\t.answer-item.correct { background: #F0FFF4; color: #2D6A4F; }\n423\t.answer-item.wrong { background: #FFF0F0; color: #E74C3C; }\n424\t\n425\t/* ===== W2: 角色 ===== */\n426\t.char-grid {\n427\t  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px;\n428\t  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px;\n429\t  align-content: start;\n430\t}\n431\t.char-card {\n432\t  background: #FFFDF7; border: 2px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 16px;\n433\t  padding: 16px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;\n434\t}\n435\t.char-card.selected { border-color: #D4A843; background: #FFF8E8; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(212,168,67,0.3); }\n436\t.char-card.locked { opacity: 0.5; cursor: default; }\n437\t.char-card:active:not(.locked) { transform: scale(0.97); }\n438\t.char-avatar { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n439\t.char-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #2C2C2C; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n440\t.char-skill { font-size: 12px; color: #8B7355; }\n441\t.char-badge {\n442\t  margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 10px; background: #D4A843; color: white;\n443\t  border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; display: inline-block;\n444\t}\n445\t.char-detail {\n446\t  padding: 16px; background: #FFFDF7; border-top: 1px solid #E8DED0;\n447\t  text-align: center;\n448\t}\n449\t.char-detail h4 { font-size: 18px; color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n450\t.skill-name { font-weight: bold; color: #2D6A4F; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n451\t.skill-desc { font-size: 14px; color: #8B7355; }\n452\t\n453\t/* ===== W3: 广告按钮 ===== */\n454\t.btn-ad {\n455\t  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A843 0%, #E8B84D 100%);\n456\t  color: white; border: none; border-radius: 12px;\n457\t  padding: 10px 24px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\n458\t  cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n459\t  transition: all 0.15s; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(212,168,67,0.3);\n460\t}\n461\t.btn-ad:active { transform: scale(0.96); }\n462\t.btn-ad:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(212,168,67,0.4); }\n463\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33562fd9-d4f0-45be-a2a4-d9d379182d9f","uuid":"0b45cfb7-35a6-428e-a354-4c47fb264abe","timestamp":"2026-05-23T10:18:27.009Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:/game-projects/douyin-idiom/src/css/style.css","content":"/* 成语大闯关 — 国风主题 */\n\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'SimSun', serif;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F5F0E8 0%, #E8DED0 100%);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color: #2C2C2C;\n}\n\n#app {\n  width: 100%; height: 100vh;\n  max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto;\n  position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.screen {\n  display: none; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  flex-direction: column; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;\n}\n.screen.active { display: flex; }\n\n/* ===== 主菜单 ===== */\n.menu-bg {\n  flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 20px;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFDF7 0%, #F5F0E8 50%, #E8DED0 100%);\n}\n\n.title-block { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n.title {\n  font-size: 42px; font-weight: 900; color: #C84B31;\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #D4A843, 4px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n  letter-spacing: 8px;\n}\n.subtitle { font-size: 16px; color: #8B7355; margin-top: 8px; letter-spacing: 4px; }\n\n.menu-stats {\n  display: flex; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 40px;\n  font-size: 16px; color: #8B7355;\n}\n.stat-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n\n.menu-buttons { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; width: 240px; }\n.menu-footer { margin-top: 40px; display: flex; gap: 16px; }\n.btn-icon {\n  width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 2px solid #D4A843;\n  border-radius: 50%; background: #FFFDF7; font-size: 20px;\n  cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n}\n.btn-icon:active { background: #F5F0E8; }\n\n/* ===== 按钮 ===== */\n.btn {\n  padding: 14px 28px; border: none; border-radius: 24px;\n  font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n}\n.btn:active { transform: scale(0.95); }\n.btn-primary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C84B31, #A63A22);\n  color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(200,75,49,0.3);\n}\n.btn-secondary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D6A4F, #1E4D33);\n  color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(45,106,79,0.3);\n}\n.btn-accent {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A843, #B8922E);\n  color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(212,168,67,0.3);\n}\n\n.btn-back {\n  background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px;\n  cursor: pointer; padding: 8px; color: #8B7355;\n}\n\n/* ===== 关卡地图 ===== */\n.map-header {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 12px 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #E8DED0;\n}\n.map-header h2 { font-size: 18px; color: #C84B31; }\n\n.chapter-info { padding: 8px 16px; }\n.chapter-badge {\n  display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;\n  font-size: 13px; color: #2C2C2C; margin-right: 8px;\n}\n\n.level-grid {\n  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n}\n\n.chapter-section {\n  margin-bottom: 16px; padding: 12px;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); border-radius: 16px;\n  border-left: 4px solid #D4A843;\n  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.level-btn {\n  width: 70px; padding: 8px 4px; border: 2px solid #E8DED0;\n  border-radius: 12px; background: #FFFDF7; cursor: pointer;\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\n  gap: 2px; transition: transform 0.1s;\n}\n.level-btn:active { transform: scale(0.95); }\n.level-btn.locked { opacity: 0.5; pointer-events: none; }\n.level-btn.completed { border-color: #27AE60; }\n.level-btn.boss {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF5E0, #FFE0B2);\n  border-color: #D4A843;\n}\n.level-num { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #C84B31; }\n.level-stars { font-size: 10px; color: #D4A843; }\n.level-name { font-size: 9px; color: #8B7355; }\n.level-btn.locked .level-num { color: #ccc; }\n\n/* ===== 游戏界面 ===== */\n.game-header {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 8px 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #E8DED0;\n}\n.header-center { display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n.header-right { font-size: 14px; }\n\n.game-body {\n  flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  padding: 12px 16px; gap: 16px; overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.combo-display {\n  font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4A843;\n  text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(212,168,67,0.5);\n  display: none; animation: comboPopIn 0.3s ease-out;\n}\n.combo-3, .combo-4 { color: #D4A843; }\n.combo-5, .combo-6, .combo-7 { color: #FF8C00; font-size: 24px; }\n.combo-8, .combo-9 { color: #FF6347; font-size: 28px; }\n.combo-10 { color: #FF4500; font-size: 32px; animation: comboShake 0.3s ease-out; }\n\n@keyframes comboPopIn {\n  0% { transform: scale(0.5); opacity: 0; }\n  100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n}\n@keyframes comboShake {\n  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n  25% { transform: translateX(-5px); }\n  75% { transform: translateX(5px); }\n}\n\n.meaning-box {\n  background: #FFFDF7; border: 2px solid #E8DED0;\n  border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 20px;\n  text-align: center; max-width: 90%; min-height: 50px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n}\n#meaning-text { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2C2C2C; }\n\n.slots-container {\n  display: flex; gap: 10px; margin: 8px 0;\n}\n\n.slot {\n  width: 60px; height: 60px;\n  border: 3px solid #8B7355; border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #FFFDF7; display: flex;\n  align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #2C2C2C;\n  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.slot.filled { background: #FFF8E8; border-color: #C84B31; }\n.slot.correct {\n  background: #27AE60; border-color: #27AE60; color: white;\n  animation: correctPulse 0.4s;\n}\n.slot.wrong {\n  background: #E74C3C; border-color: #E74C3C; color: white;\n  animation: wrongShake 0.5s;\n}\n\n@keyframes correctPulse {\n  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }\n  50% { transform: scale(1.12); }\n}\n@keyframes wrongShake {\n  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n  25% { transform: translateX(-8px); }\n  75% { transform: translateX(8px); }\n}\n\n.idiom-hint {\n  font-size: 13px; color: #8B7355; text-align: center;\n  padding: 6px 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\n  border-radius: 8px; display: none; max-width: 90%;\n}\n.idiom-hint strong { color: #C84B31; }\n\n.candidates-container {\n  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;\n  justify-content: center; max-width: 340px; margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.candidate {\n  width: 48px; height: 48px; border: none; border-radius: 10px;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C84B31, #A63A22);\n  color: white; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n}\n.candidate:active { transform: scale(0.9); }\n.candidate.used {\n  opacity: 0.25; pointer-events: none; transform: scale(0.9);\n}\n.candidate.removed {\n  opacity: 0.1; pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.game-footer {\n  display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px;\n  padding: 12px 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);\n  border-top: 1px solid #E8DED0;\n}\n\n.tool-btn {\n  padding: 8px 16px; border: 2px solid #2D6A4F;\n  border-radius: 20px; background: white;\n  color: #2D6A4F; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n.tool-btn:active { background: #2D6A4F; color: white; }\n\n/* ===== 教学覆盖层 ===== */\n.tutorial-overlay {\n  position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); padding: 20px;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  z-index: 100;\n}\n.tutorial-text {\n  color: white; font-size: 16px; text-align: center;\n  line-height: 1.5; max-width: 80%;\n}\n\n/* ===== 结算界面 ===== */\n.result-card {\n  flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFDF7, #F5F0E8);\n  padding: 40px 20px;\n}\n\n.result-title {\n  font-size: 36px; color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.result-stars {\n  font-size: 40px; color: #D4A843; margin-bottom: 20px;\n  display: flex; gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.result-stats {\n  text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 2;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n.coins-earned {\n  font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #D4A843;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.result-buttons {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; width: 220px;\n}\n\n/* ===== 模态框 ===== */\n.modal {\n  position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); display: flex;\n  align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 200;\n}\n.modal-content {\n  background: #FFFDF7; border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px;\n  text-align: center; max-width: 320px; width: 90%;\n}\n.modal-content h3 { font-size: 22px; color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.modal-content p { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #8B7355; }\n.modal-buttons { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }\n\n/* ===== W2: 通用 ===== */\n.btn-outline {\n  padding: 10px 16px; border: 2px solid #D4A843; border-radius: 20px;\n  background: transparent; color: #8B7355; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n.btn-outline:active { background: #FFF8E8; }\n.btn-sm { padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 14px; }\n\n.menu-row {\n  display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n/* ===== W2: 计时器 ===== */\n.timer-display {\n  font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #C84B31;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.timer-warning { color: #E74C3C; animation: timerPulse 0.5s infinite; }\n@keyframes timerPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0.5; }\n}\n\n/* ===== W2: 成语图鉴 ===== */\n.col-bar-wrap { padding: 8px 16px; }\n.col-bar {\n  height: 8px; background: #E8DED0; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\n}\n.col-bar-fill {\n  height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2D6A4F, #27AE60);\n  border-radius: 4px; transition: width 0.3s;\n}\n.col-search {\n  display: block; width: calc(100% - 32px); margin: 8px 16px;\n  padding: 10px 14px; border: 2px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 12px;\n  font-size: 14px; background: #FFFDF7; outline: none;\n}\n.col-search:focus { border-color: #C84B31; }\n.col-categories {\n  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 16px 8px;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n}\n.cat-btn {\n  padding: 4px 12px; border: 1px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 14px;\n  background: #FFFDF7; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;\n  color: #8B7355;\n}\n.cat-btn.active { background: #C84B31; color: white; border-color: #C84B31; }\n.col-grid {\n  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 8px 16px;\n  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(80px, 1fr));\n  gap: 8px; align-content: start;\n}\n.idiom-card {\n  background: #FFFDF7; border: 2px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 8px 4px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n.idiom-card.collected { border-color: #2D6A4F; background: #F0FFF4; }\n.idiom-card:active { transform: scale(0.95); }\n.idiom-text { display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #2C2C2C; }\n.idiom-card:not(.collected) .idiom-text { color: #ccc; }\n.idiom-cat { display: block; font-size: 10px; color: #8B7355; margin-top: 2px; }\n.more-hint {\n  grid-column: 1 / -1; text-align: center; font-size: 13px;\n  color: #8B7355; padding: 8px;\n}\n.col-detail {\n  position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n  background: #FFFDF7; border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0; padding: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 -4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); max-height: 60vh; overflow-y: auto;\n  z-index: 50;\n}\n.detail-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.detail-header h3 { font-size: 24px; color: #C84B31; }\n.detail-pinyin { color: #8B7355; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.detail-meaning { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.detail-origin { font-size: 13px; color: #8B7355; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.detail-example { font-size: 13px; color: #2D6A4F; font-style: italic; }\n.detail-locked { color: #8B7355; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }\n\n/* ===== W2: 每日系统 ===== */\n.daily-content { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px; }\n.daily-login {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF8E8, #F5F0E8);\n  border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 16px;\n  border: 2px solid #D4A843;\n}\n.daily-login h3 { color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.streak-num { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4A843; }\n.daily-section { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.daily-section h3 { font-size: 16px; color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.task-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }\n.task-item {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n  background: #FFFDF7; border: 1px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n}\n.task-item.done { opacity: 0.6; }\n.task-desc { font-size: 14px; flex: 1; }\n.task-progress { font-size: 13px; color: #8B7355; margin: 0 8px; }\n.task-btn {\n  padding: 4px 12px; border: 1px solid #2D6A4F; border-radius: 12px;\n  background: white; color: #2D6A4F; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;\n}\n.task-btn.claimed { background: #F0F0F0; color: #999; border-color: #ddd; }\n.task-btn:disabled { cursor: default; }\n.challenge-card {\n  background: #FFFDF7; border: 2px solid #D4A843; border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 16px; text-align: center;\n}\n.challenge-card.done { border-color: #2D6A4F; background: #F0FFF4; }\n.challenge-card h4 { color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.challenge-meaning { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.challenge-hint { font-size: 14px; color: #8B7355; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.challenge-done { color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: bold; }\n\n/* ===== W2: PK ===== */\n.pk-answers { margin: 12px 0; text-align: left; max-width: 280px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }\n.answer-item {\n  padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n.answer-item.correct { background: #F0FFF4; color: #2D6A4F; }\n.answer-item.wrong { background: #FFF0F0; color: #E74C3C; }\n\n/* ===== W2: 角色 ===== */\n.char-grid {\n  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px;\n  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px;\n  align-content: start;\n}\n.char-card {\n  background: #FFFDF7; border: 2px solid #E8DED0; border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 16px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n.char-card.selected { border-color: #D4A843; background: #FFF8E8; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(212,168,67,0.3); }\n.char-card.locked { opacity: 0.5; cursor: default; }\n.char-card:active:not(.locked) { transform: scale(0.97); }\n.char-avatar { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.char-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #2C2C2C; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.char-skill { font-size: 12px; color: #8B7355; }\n.char-badge {\n  margin-top: 8px; padding: 2px 10px; background: #D4A843; color: white;\n  border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; display: inline-block;\n}\n.char-detail {\n  padding: 16px; background: #FFFDF7; border-top: 1px solid #E8DED0;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.char-detail h4 { font-size: 18px; color: #C84B31; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.skill-name { font-weight: bold; color: #2D6A4F; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n.skill-desc { font-size: 14px; color: #8B7355; }\n\n/* ===== W3: 广告按钮 ===== */\n.btn-ad {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A843 0%, #E8B84D 100%);\n  color: white; border: none; border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 10px 24px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n  transition: all 0.15s; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(212,168,67,0.3);\n}\n.btn-ad:active { transform: scale(0.96); }\n.btn-ad:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(212,168,67,0.4); }\n","numLines":463,"startLine":1,"totalLines":463}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_7d861e23348e486db3b385bd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// AdManager.js — 成语大闯关穿山甲SDK广告管理，适配DOM渲染\n2\t// 广告位ID配置在 ad-config.js 中，提审前替换为真实ID\n3\t\n4\tconst AD_PLACEMENTS = {\n5\t  HINT_REVEAL: 'hint_reveal',       // 揭示1字（激励视频）\n6\t  HINT_REMOVE: 'hint_remove',       // 去干扰（激励视频）\n7\t  DOUBLE_REWARD: 'double_reward',   // 双倍结算（激励视频）\n8\t  CONTINUE: 'continue',             // 续命（激励视频）\n9\t  INTERSTITIAL: 'interstitial',     // 关卡间插屏\n10\t  DAILY_DOUBLE: 'daily_double',     // 每日签到翻倍（激励视频）\n11\t};\n12\t\n13\tconst AD_LIMITS = {\n14\t  REWARDED_DAILY: 15,\n15\t  INTERSTITIAL_DAILY: 8,\n16\t  COOLDOWN_MS: 90000,\n17\t  NEW_USER_FREE_LEVELS: 3,\n18\t  INTERSTITIAL_LEVEL_INTERVAL: 2,\n19\t};\n20\t\n21\tclass AdManager {\n22\t  constructor(dataManager) {\n23\t    this.dm = dataManager;\n24\t    this._initStorage();\n25\t\n26\t    const config = (typeof AD_CONFIG !== 'undefined') ? AD_CONFIG : null;\n27\t    this.isDouyin = config ? !config.devMode\n28\t      : (typeof tt !== 'undefined' && typeof tt.createRewardedVideoAd === 'function');\n29\t    this.rewardedAd = null;\n30\t    this.interstitialAd = null;\n31\t    this._loadRetry = 0;\n32\t    this._maxRetry = config ? config.loadRetryCount : 2;\n33\t    this._loadTimeout = config ? config.loadTimeout : 10000;\n34\t\n35\t    if (this.isDouyin) this._initSDK();\n36\t\n37\t    this._pendingResolve = null;\n38\t    this._currentPlacement = null;\n39\t    this._showingUI = false;\n40\t    this._stubTimer = 0;\n41\t    this._stubResolve = null;\n42\t    this._stubPlacement = null;\n43\t    this._stubInterstitial = false;\n44\t  }\n45\t\n46\t  _initStorage() {\n47\t    if (!this.dm.data.adState) {\n48\t      this.dm.data.adState = {\n49\t        dailyRewarded: 0,\n50\t        dailyInterstitial: 0,\n51\t        lastShowTime: {},\n52\t        lastInterstitialLevel: 0,\n53\t        date: this._todayStr(),\n54\t        consecutiveFails: 0,\n55\t      };\n56\t      this.dm.save();\n57\t    }\n58\t    this.adState = this.dm.data.adState;\n59\t    this._resetDaily();\n60\t  }\n61\t\n62\t  _todayStr() { return new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10); }\n63\t\n64\t  _resetDaily() {\n65\t    if (this.adState.date !== this._todayStr()) {\n66\t      this.adState.dailyRewarded = 0;\n67\t      this.adState.dailyInterstitial = 0;\n68\t      this.adState.date = this._todayStr();\n69\t      this.dm.save();\n70\t    }\n71\t  }\n72\t\n73\t  _getAdUnitId(type) {\n74\t    const config = (typeof AD_CONFIG !== 'undefined') ? AD_CONFIG : null;\n75\t    if (config && config.adUnitIds && config.adUnitIds[type]) return config.adUnitIds[type];\n76\t    return `adunit-placeholder-${type}`;\n77\t  }\n78\t\n79\t  _initSDK() {\n80\t    try {\n81\t      const rewardedId = this._getAdUnitId('rewarded');\n82\t      this.rewardedAd = tt.createRewardedVideoAd({ adUnitId: rewardedId });\n83\t      this.rewardedAd.onLoad(() => { this._loadRetry = 0; });\n84\t      this.rewardedAd.onError((err) => {\n85\t        console.warn('[AdManager] Rewarded ad error:', err);\n86\t        if (this._loadRetry < this._maxRetry) {\n87\t          this._loadRetry++;\n88\t          setTimeout(() => this.rewardedAd.load(), 1000 * this._loadRetry);\n89\t        }\n90\t      });\n91\t      this.rewardedAd.onClose((res) => {\n92\t        if (this._pendingResolve) {\n93\t          this._pendingResolve(res && res.isEnded);\n94\t          this._pendingResolve = null;\n95\t        }\n96\t      });\n97\t      this.rewardedAd.load();\n98\t\n99\t      const interstitialId = this._getAdUnitId('interstitial');\n100\t      this.interstitialAd = tt.createInterstitialAd({ adUnitId: interstitialId });\n101\t      this.interstitialAd.onLoad(() => {});\n102\t      this.interstitialAd.onError((err) => { console.warn('[AdManager] Interstitial ad error:', err); });\n103\t    } catch (e) {\n104\t      console.warn('[AdManager] SDK init failed, falling back to stub:', e);\n105\t      this.isDouyin = false;\n106\t    }\n107\t  }\n108\t\n109\t  isNewUser() { return this.dm.unlockedLevel <= AD_LIMITS.NEW_USER_FREE_LEVELS; }\n110\t\n111\t  canShowRewarded(placement) {\n112\t    this._resetDaily();\n113\t    if (this.isNewUser()) return false;\n114\t    if (this.adState.dailyRewarded >= AD_LIMITS.REWARDED_DAILY) return false;\n115\t    if (this._inCooldown(placement)) return false;\n116\t    return true;\n117\t  }\n118\t\n119\t  canShowInterstitial(currentLevel) {\n120\t    this._resetDaily();\n121\t    if (this.isNewUser()) return false;\n122\t    if (this.adState.dailyInterstitial >= AD_LIMITS.INTERSTITIAL_DAILY) return false;\n123\t    if (this.adState.consecutiveFails >= 2) return false;\n124\t    const lastLevel = this.adState.lastInterstitialLevel || 0;\n125\t    if (currentLevel - lastLevel < AD_LIMITS.INTERSTITIAL_LEVEL_INTERVAL) return false;\n126\t    if (this._inCooldown(AD_PLACEMENTS.INTERSTITIAL)) return false;\n127\t    return true;\n128\t  }\n129\t\n130\t  _inCooldown(placement) {\n131\t    const last = this.adState.lastShowTime[placement] || 0;\n132\t    return Date.now() - last < AD_LIMITS.COOLDOWN_MS;\n133\t  }\n134\t\n135\t  showRewarded(placement) {\n136\t    if (!this.canShowRewarded(placement)) return Promise.resolve(false);\n137\t    this._currentPlacement = placement;\n138\t\n139\t    if (this.isDouyin && this.rewardedAd) {\n140\t      return new Promise((resolve) => {\n141\t        this._pendingResolve = resolve;\n142\t        this.rewardedAd.show().catch(() => {\n143\t          this.rewardedAd.load().then(() => {\n144\t            this.rewardedAd.show().catch(() => resolve(false));\n145\t          }).catch(() => resolve(false));\n146\t        });\n147\t      }).then((success) => {\n148\t        if (success) this._onAdComplete(placement);\n149\t        return success;\n150\t      });\n151\t    }\n152\t\n153\t    return this._showStubAd(placement);\n154\t  }\n155\t\n156\t  showInterstitial(currentLevel) {\n157\t    if (!this.canShowInterstitial(currentLevel)) return Promise.resolve(false);\n158\t\n159\t    if (this.isDouyin && this.interstitialAd) {\n160\t      return new Promise((resolve) => {\n161\t        this.interstitialAd.show().then(() => {\n162\t          this.adState.dailyInterstitial++;\n163\t          this.adState.lastInterstitialLevel = currentLevel;\n164\t          this.adState.lastShowTime[AD_PLACEMENTS.INTERSTITIAL] = Date.now();\n165\t          this.dm.save();\n166\t          setTimeout(() => resolve(true), 5000);\n167\t        }).catch(() => resolve(false));\n168\t      });\n169\t    }\n170\t\n171\t    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n172\t      this._showingUI = true;\n173\t      this._stubInterstitial = true;\n174\t      this._stubTimer = 3;\n175\t      this.adState.dailyInterstitial++;\n176\t      this.adState.lastInterstitialLevel = currentLevel;\n177\t      this.adState.lastShowTime[AD_PLACEMENTS.INTERSTITIAL] = Date.now();\n178\t      this.dm.save();\n179\t      this._renderStubUI();\n180\t      setTimeout(() => {\n181\t        this._showingUI = false;\n182\t        this._stubInterstitial = false;\n183\t        this._removeStubUI();\n184\t        resolve(true);\n185\t      }, 3000);\n186\t    });\n187\t  }\n188\t\n189\t  _onAdComplete(placement) {\n190\t    this.adState.dailyRewarded++;\n191\t    this.adState.lastShowTime[placement] = Date.now();\n192\t    this.dm.save();\n193\t  }\n194\t\n195\t  _showStubAd(placement) {\n196\t    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n197\t      this._showingUI = true;\n198\t      this._stubPlacement = placement;\n199\t      this._stubTimer = 3;\n200\t      this._stubResolve = resolve;\n201\t      this._renderStubUI();\n202\t    });\n203\t  }\n204\t\n205\t  _completeStubAd(watched) {\n206\t    this._showingUI = false;\n207\t    if (watched) this._onAdComplete(this._stubPlacement);\n208\t    this._removeStubUI();\n209\t    if (this._stubResolve) {\n210\t      this._stubResolve(watched);\n211\t      this._stubResolve = null;\n212\t    }\n213\t  }\n214\t\n215\t  reportFail() { this.adState.consecutiveFails++; this.dm.save(); }\n216\t  reportSuccess() { this.adState.consecutiveFails = 0; this.dm.save(); }\n217\t\n218\t  // DOM-based stub ad rendering (适配成语游戏的HTML渲染)\n219\t  _renderStubUI() {\n220\t    if (document.getElementById('stub-ad-overlay')) return;\n221\t    const overlay = document.createElement('div');\n222\t    overlay.id = 'stub-ad-overlay';\n223\t    overlay.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);z-index:10000;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:sans-serif;';\n224\t\n225\t    if (this._stubInterstitial) {\n226\t      overlay.innerHTML = `\n227\t        <div style=\"color:#FFB800;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:10px\">📢 广告</div>\n228\t        <div style=\"color:#CCC;font-size:14px\">插屏广告模拟</div>\n229\t        <div id=\"stub-timer\" style=\"color:#FFB800;font-size:28px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:20px\">3s</div>`;\n230\t    } else {\n231\t      overlay.innerHTML = `\n232\t        <div style=\"color:#FFB800;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:10px\">🎬 激励视频广告</div>\n233\t        <div style=\"color:#FFF;font-size:14px\">广告位: ${this._stubPlacement || ''}</div>\n234\t        <div style=\"color:#999;font-size:12px;margin-top:5px\">（开发模式模拟广告）</div>\n235\t        <div id=\"stub-timer\" style=\"color:#FFB800;font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:20px\">3s</div>\n236\t        <button id=\"stub-complete-btn\" style=\"display:none;margin-top:20px;padding:12px 40px;background:#6BCB77;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer\">✓ 观看完成</button>\n237\t        <button id=\"stub-skip-btn\" style=\"display:none;margin-top:10px;padding:8px 20px;background:transparent;color:#888;border:none;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer\">跳过（无奖励）</button>`;\n238\t    }\n239\t    document.body.appendChild(overlay);\n240\t\n241\t    const timerEl = document.getElementById('stub-timer');\n242\t    const interval = setInterval(() => {\n243\t      this._stubTimer--;\n244\t      if (timerEl) timerEl.textContent = this._stubTimer > 0 ? `${this._stubTimer}s` : '';\n245\t      if (this._stubTimer <= 0) {\n246\t        clearInterval(interval);\n247\t        const completeBtn = document.getElementById('stub-complete-btn');\n248\t        const skipBtn = document.getElementById('stub-skip-btn');\n249\t        if (completeBtn) {\n250\t          completeBtn.style.display = 'block';\n251\t          completeBtn.onclick = () => this._completeStubAd(true);\n252\t        }\n253\t        if (skipBtn) {\n254\t          skipBtn.style.display = 'block';\n255\t          skipBtn.onclick = () => this._completeStubAd(false);\n256\t        }\n257\t      }\n258\t    }, 1000);\n259\t  }\n260\t\n261\t  _removeStubUI() {\n262\t    const overlay = document.getElementById('stub-ad-overlay');\n263\t    if (overlay) overlay.remove();\n264\t  }\n265\t\n266\t  // Ad button visibility helper\n267\t  static shouldShowAdButton(adManager, placement) {\n268\t    return adManager && adManager.canShowRewarded(placement);\n269\t  }\n270\t}\n271\t\n272\tif (typeof module !== 'undefined') module.exports = { AdManager, AD_PLACEMENTS, AD_LIMITS };\n273\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33562fd9-d4f0-45be-a2a4-d9d379182d9f","uuid":"20ee654c-dcb3-4538-927f-1aab1b2c660d","timestamp":"2026-05-23T10:18:27.029Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:/game-projects/douyin-idiom/src/js/AdManager.js","content":"// AdManager.js — 成语大闯关穿山甲SDK广告管理，适配DOM渲染\n// 广告位ID配置在 ad-config.js 中，提审前替换为真实ID\n\nconst AD_PLACEMENTS = {\n  HINT_REVEAL: 'hint_reveal',       // 揭示1字（激励视频）\n  HINT_REMOVE: 'hint_remove',       // 去干扰（激励视频）\n  DOUBLE_REWARD: 'double_reward',   // 双倍结算（激励视频）\n  CONTINUE: 'continue',             // 续命（激励视频）\n  INTERSTITIAL: 'interstitial',     // 关卡间插屏\n  DAILY_DOUBLE: 'daily_double',     // 每日签到翻倍（激励视频）\n};\n\nconst AD_LIMITS = {\n  REWARDED_DAILY: 15,\n  INTERSTITIAL_DAILY: 8,\n  COOLDOWN_MS: 90000,\n  NEW_USER_FREE_LEVELS: 3,\n  INTERSTITIAL_LEVEL_INTERVAL: 2,\n};\n\nclass AdManager {\n  constructor(dataManager) {\n    this.dm = dataManager;\n    this._initStorage();\n\n    const config = (typeof AD_CONFIG !== 'undefined') ? AD_CONFIG : null;\n    this.isDouyin = config ? !config.devMode\n      : (typeof tt !== 'undefined' && typeof tt.createRewardedVideoAd === 'function');\n    this.rewardedAd = null;\n    this.interstitialAd = null;\n    this._loadRetry = 0;\n    this._maxRetry = config ? config.loadRetryCount : 2;\n    this._loadTimeout = config ? config.loadTimeout : 10000;\n\n    if (this.isDouyin) this._initSDK();\n\n    this._pendingResolve = null;\n    this._currentPlacement = null;\n    this._showingUI = false;\n    this._stubTimer = 0;\n    this._stubResolve = null;\n    this._stubPlacement = null;\n    this._stubInterstitial = false;\n  }\n\n  _initStorage() {\n    if (!this.dm.data.adState) {\n      this.dm.data.adState = {\n        dailyRewarded: 0,\n        dailyInterstitial: 0,\n        lastShowTime: {},\n        lastInterstitialLevel: 0,\n        date: this._todayStr(),\n        consecutiveFails: 0,\n      };\n      this.dm.save();\n    }\n    this.adState = this.dm.data.adState;\n    this._resetDaily();\n  }\n\n  _todayStr() { return new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10); }\n\n  _resetDaily() {\n    if (this.adState.date !== this._todayStr()) {\n      this.adState.dailyRewarded = 0;\n      this.adState.dailyInterstitial = 0;\n      this.adState.date = this._todayStr();\n      this.dm.save();\n    }\n  }\n\n  _getAdUnitId(type) {\n    const config = (typeof AD_CONFIG !== 'undefined') ? AD_CONFIG : null;\n    if (config && config.adUnitIds && config.adUnitIds[type]) return config.adUnitIds[type];\n    return `adunit-placeholder-${type}`;\n  }\n\n  _initSDK() {\n    try {\n      const rewardedId = this._getAdUnitId('rewarded');\n      this.rewardedAd = tt.createRewardedVideoAd({ adUnitId: rewardedId });\n      this.rewardedAd.onLoad(() => { this._loadRetry = 0; });\n      this.rewardedAd.onError((err) => {\n        console.warn('[AdManager] Rewarded ad error:', err);\n        if (this._loadRetry < this._maxRetry) {\n          this._loadRetry++;\n          setTimeout(() => this.rewardedAd.load(), 1000 * this._loadRetry);\n        }\n      });\n      this.rewardedAd.onClose((res) => {\n        if (this._pendingResolve) {\n          this._pendingResolve(res && res.isEnded);\n          this._pendingResolve = null;\n        }\n      });\n      this.rewardedAd.load();\n\n      const interstitialId = this._getAdUnitId('interstitial');\n      this.interstitialAd = tt.createInterstitialAd({ adUnitId: interstitialId });\n      this.interstitialAd.onLoad(() => {});\n      this.interstitialAd.onError((err) => { console.warn('[AdManager] Interstitial ad error:', err); });\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('[AdManager] SDK init failed, falling back to stub:', e);\n      this.isDouyin = false;\n    }\n  }\n\n  isNewUser() { return this.dm.unlockedLevel <= AD_LIMITS.NEW_USER_FREE_LEVELS; }\n\n  canShowRewarded(placement) {\n    this._resetDaily();\n    if (this.isNewUser()) return false;\n    if (this.adState.dailyRewarded >= AD_LIMITS.REWARDED_DAILY) return false;\n    if (this._inCooldown(placement)) return false;\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  canShowInterstitial(currentLevel) {\n    this._resetDaily();\n    if (this.isNewUser()) return false;\n    if (this.adState.dailyInterstitial >= AD_LIMITS.INTERSTITIAL_DAILY) return false;\n    if (this.adState.consecutiveFails >= 2) return false;\n    const lastLevel = this.adState.lastInterstitialLevel || 0;\n    if (currentLevel - lastLevel < AD_LIMITS.INTERSTITIAL_LEVEL_INTERVAL) return false;\n    if (this._inCooldown(AD_PLACEMENTS.INTERSTITIAL)) return false;\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  _inCooldown(placement) {\n    const last = this.adState.lastShowTime[placement] || 0;\n    return Date.now() - last < AD_LIMITS.COOLDOWN_MS;\n  }\n\n  showRewarded(placement) {\n    if (!this.canShowRewarded(placement)) return Promise.resolve(false);\n    this._currentPlacement = placement;\n\n    if (this.isDouyin && this.rewardedAd) {\n      return new Promise((resolve) => {\n        this._pendingResolve = resolve;\n        this.rewardedAd.show().catch(() => {\n          this.rewardedAd.load().then(() => {\n            this.rewardedAd.show().catch(() => resolve(false));\n          }).catch(() => resolve(false));\n        });\n      }).then((success) => {\n        if (success) this._onAdComplete(placement);\n        return success;\n      });\n    }\n\n    return this._showStubAd(placement);\n  }\n\n  showInterstitial(currentLevel) {\n    if (!this.canShowInterstitial(currentLevel)) return Promise.resolve(false);\n\n    if (this.isDouyin && this.interstitialAd) {\n      return new Promise((resolve) => {\n        this.interstitialAd.show().then(() => {\n          this.adState.dailyInterstitial++;\n          this.adState.lastInterstitialLevel = currentLevel;\n          this.adState.lastShowTime[AD_PLACEMENTS.INTERSTITIAL] = Date.now();\n          this.dm.save();\n          setTimeout(() => resolve(true), 5000);\n        }).catch(() => resolve(false));\n      });\n    }\n\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n      this._showingUI = true;\n      this._stubInterstitial = true;\n      this._stubTimer = 3;\n      this.adState.dailyInterstitial++;\n      this.adState.lastInterstitialLevel = currentLevel;\n      this.adState.lastShowTime[AD_PLACEMENTS.INTERSTITIAL] = Date.now();\n      this.dm.save();\n      this._renderStubUI();\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        this._showingUI = false;\n        this._stubInterstitial = false;\n        this._removeStubUI();\n        resolve(true);\n      }, 3000);\n    });\n  }\n\n  _onAdComplete(placement) {\n    this.adState.dailyRewarded++;\n    this.adState.lastShowTime[placement] = Date.now();\n    this.dm.save();\n  }\n\n  _showStubAd(placement) {\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n      this._showingUI = true;\n      this._stubPlacement = placement;\n      this._stubTimer = 3;\n      this._stubResolve = resolve;\n      this._renderStubUI();\n    });\n  }\n\n  _completeStubAd(watched) {\n    this._showingUI = false;\n    if (watched) this._onAdComplete(this._stubPlacement);\n    this._removeStubUI();\n    if (this._stubResolve) {\n      this._stubResolve(watched);\n      this._stubResolve = null;\n    }\n  }\n\n  reportFail() { this.adState.consecutiveFails++; this.dm.save(); }\n  reportSuccess() { this.adState.consecutiveFails = 0; this.dm.save(); }\n\n  // DOM-based stub ad rendering (适配成语游戏的HTML渲染)\n  _renderStubUI() {\n    if (document.getElementById('stub-ad-overlay')) return;\n    const overlay = document.createElement('div');\n    overlay.id = 'stub-ad-overlay';\n    overlay.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);z-index:10000;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:sans-serif;';\n\n    if (this._stubInterstitial) {\n      overlay.innerHTML = `\n        <div style=\"color:#FFB800;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:10px\">📢 广告</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#CCC;font-size:14px\">插屏广告模拟</div>\n        <div id=\"stub-timer\" style=\"color:#FFB800;font-size:28px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:20px\">3s</div>`;\n    } else {\n      overlay.innerHTML = `\n        <div style=\"color:#FFB800;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:10px\">🎬 激励视频广告</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#FFF;font-size:14px\">广告位: ${this._stubPlacement || ''}</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#999;font-size:12px;margin-top:5px\">（开发模式模拟广告）</div>\n        <div id=\"stub-timer\" style=\"color:#FFB800;font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:20px\">3s</div>\n        <button id=\"stub-complete-btn\" style=\"display:none;margin-top:20px;padding:12px 40px;background:#6BCB77;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer\">✓ 观看完成</button>\n        <button id=\"stub-skip-btn\" style=\"display:none;margin-top:10px;padding:8px 20px;background:transparent;color:#888;border:none;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer\">跳过（无奖励）</button>`;\n    }\n    document.body.appendChild(overlay);\n\n    const timerEl = document.getElementById('stub-timer');\n    const interval = setInterval(() => {\n      this._stubTimer--;\n      if (timerEl) timerEl.textContent = this._stubTimer > 0 ? `${this._stubTimer}s` : '';\n      if (this._stubTimer <= 0) {\n        clearInterval(interval);\n        const completeBtn = document.getElementById('stub-complete-btn');\n        const skipBtn = document.getElementById('stub-skip-btn');\n        if (completeBtn) {\n          completeBtn.style.display = 'block';\n          completeBtn.onclick = () => this._completeStubAd(true);\n        }\n        if (skipBtn) {\n          skipBtn.style.display = 'block';\n          skipBtn.onclick = () => this._completeStubAd(false);\n        }\n      }\n    }, 1000);\n  }\n\n  _removeStubUI() {\n    const overlay = document.getElementById('stub-ad-overlay');\n    if (overlay) overlay.remove();\n  }\n\n  // Ad button visibility helper\n  static shouldShowAdButton(adManager, placement) {\n    return adManager && adManager.canShowRewarded(placement);\n  }\n}\n\nif (typeof module !== 'undefined') module.exports = { AdManager, AD_PLACEMENTS, AD_LIMITS };\n","numLines":273,"startLine":1,"totalLines":273}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026052318182825eecd44a6624680","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of both games. Let me summarize the issues I've found:\n\n## Match-3 Game Issues\n\n### CRITICAL BUG: Navigation screens non-responsive on touch devices\n\nIn `index.html` line 83, the Navigation click handler uses a `click` event:\n```javascript\ncanvas.addEventListener('click', (e) => { ... game.nav.handleClick(x, y, w, h); ... });\n```\n\nBut in `InputHandler.js` lines 33-49, touch events have `e.preventDefault()`:\n```javascript\nthis.canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', e => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  ...\n}, { passive: false });\nthis.canvas.addEventListener('touchmove', e => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  ...\n}, { passive: false });\nthis.canvas.addEventListener('touchend', e => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  ...\n}, { passive: false });\n```\n\nCalling `preventDefault()` on `touchstart` prevents the browser from dispatching a synthetic `click` event. This means on touch devices:\n- Users cannot tap navigation buttons (menu, map, shop, etc.)\n- The game is unplayable on mobile\n\n### BUG: No coordinate offset accounting in Navigation click handler\n\nIn `index.html` line 91-92:\n```javascript\nconst rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\nconst x = e.clientX - rect.left;\nconst y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n```\n\nThis correctly subtracts the canvas bounding rect. But in `InputHandler.js` lines 28-30, mouse events use `e.clientX` and `e.clientY` directly without subtracting the canvas offset:\n```javascript\nthis.canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', e => this._onPointerDown(e.clientX, e.clientY));\n```\n\nSince the canvas is full-screen (100% width/height with no margins/padding), this works. But if the canvas had any offset, mouse coordinates would be wrong. This is minor since the canvas IS full-screen.\n\n### ISSUE: `_lastInteraction` race condition\n\nThe `_lastInteraction` tracking in InputHandler is used to coordinate between touch events and click events. However, there's a potential race condition since it's set in `_onPointerUp` and checked in the click handler. In practice this might work fine since events are processed in order on the same thread.\n\n### BUG: Back-to-map button only handles click, not touch\n\nIn `index.html` lines 107-112, the back-to-map button check is inside the `click` event handler:\n```javascript\nif (x >= backX && x <= backX + 40 && y >= backY && y <= backY + 28) {\n  game.nav.goTo('map');\n  return;\n}\n```\n\nSince the `click` event is suppressed by `preventDefault()` on touch events, this button won't work on touch devices either.\n\n### MINOR: Canvas resize not accounting for safe areas\n\nThe `Renderer.resize()` method doesn't account for CSS safe area insets (notch, bottom bar) which are common on modern phones. On iPhone X+ models with a notch, the board might overlap with the status bar area. However, since the game targets Douyin (Android primarily), this is less critical.\n\n### ISSUE: No touch feedback for navigation buttons\n\nNavigation buttons don't have any visual touch feedback (press animation, color change) since they're canvas-drawn. This makes the mobile UX feel unresponsive.\n\n## Idiom Game Issues\n\n### BUG: Using `onclick` inline handlers works but has 300ms delay\n\nThe idiom game uses inline `onclick` handlers on DOM elements. While these work on mobile, they have a ~300ms delay on some older mobile browsers. However, modern browsers with `<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">` don't have this delay, so this is actually fine for the target platform (Douyin mini-game runtime is based on modern Chromium).\n\n### BUG: `confirm()` dialog blocks touch interaction\n\nIn `index.html` lines 54 and 122:\n```html\n<button class=\"btn-back\" onclick=\"if(confirm('确定退出？')) game.goToMenu()\">✕</button>\n```\n\nThe `confirm()` dialog may not work properly on some mobile browsers and Douyin mini-game runtime. It should use a custom modal instead.\n\n### ISSUE: Text input lacks mobile optimization\n\nThe search input in the collection screen:\n```html\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"col-search\" class=\"col-search\" placeholder=\"搜索成语/释义...\" oninput=\"handleColSearch(this.value)\">\n```\n\nMissing attributes:\n- `autocomplete=\"off\"` - prevents autocomplete suggestions from covering the game\n- `autocapitalize=\"none\"` - Chinese input doesn't need capitalization\n- No `inputmode` hint for Chinese input\n\n### ISSUE: Scroll lists might have rubber-banding issues\n\nThe level grid scroll:\n```css\n.level-grid {\n  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n}\n```\n\n`-webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch` enables momentum scrolling on iOS but can cause issues with:\n- Position fixed elements inside scroll containers\n- Content rendering artifacts during fast scroll\n\nOn Douyin mini-games (Android), this property is not needed and is harmless.\n\n### ISSUE: `#app` has `max-width: 480px` which might be too narrow\n\nOn tablet devices or landscape mode, the game area is limited to 480px which might not utilize the full screen. However, for a phone game targeting Douyin, this is acceptable.\n\n### BUG: Collection grid innerHTML rendering is slow\n\nThe `renderCollection` function rebuilds the entire grid HTML on each render call:\n```javascript\ngrid.innerHTML = idioms.slice(0, 60).map(i => `...`).join('');\n```\n\nThis causes layout thrashing on each character input in the search field. Should debounce or use virtual scrolling.\n\n### ISSUE: No touch-action CSS on game elements\n\nThe CSS doesn't have `touch-action: manipulation` on interactive elements. This could cause:\n- Double-tap zoom on some browsers\n- Unwanted gestures interfering with gameplay\n\nThe match-3 game has `touch-action: none` on the body, which is better.\n\n### BUG: Missing `touch-action` on interactive elements\n\nUnlike the match-3 game which has `touch-action: none` on body, the idiom game only has `user-scalable=no` in the viewport meta. Some browsers may still trigger gestures like pull-to-refresh or double-tap zoom on interactive elements.\n\nNow let me create the fixes and tests.\n\n## Plan:\n\n1. **Match-3 game**: Fix the critical touch/click conflict by adding touch event handling to Navigation\n2. **Idiom game**: Fix touch-action, search input, confirm dialogs, and scroll issues\n3. Write automated tests\n4. Write test report\n\nLet me start implementing the fixes.\n\nFor the match-3 game, the fix is to:\n1. Add a touch handler alongside the click handler in index.html\n2. OR modify InputHandler to not preventDefault when Navigation is active\n3. OR add touchstart handling to Navigation\n\nThe cleanest fix is to add a `touchstart` event listener that routes to Navigation when a navigation screen is active, and only call `preventDefault()` in InputHandler when the game is actually in the GAME screen.\n\nActually, the cleanest fix is:\n1. In InputHandler, only preventDefault when the game is NOT on a navigation screen\n2. OR, add touch handling to the main click handler\n\nLet me think about this more carefully...\n\nThe issue is that InputHandler always registers touch events and always calls preventDefault. But when Navigation is active, we don't need InputHandler's touch handling at all.\n\nThe fix should be:\n1. Make InputHandler aware of navigation state\n2. When navigation is active, skip InputHandler's touch processing and don't preventDefault\n3. Add a separate touchstart handler that routes to Navigation.handleClick\n\nActually, the simplest fix is to add touch handling alongside the click handler in index.html, and modify InputHandler to conditionally preventDefault.\n\nLet me implement this.\n\nFor the match-3 game fix:\n\n**InputHandler.js changes:**\n- Add a method to disable touch event interception\n- Or better: check if input is enabled before calling preventDefault\n\nActually, the best approach:\n1. In `InputHandler._bindEvents`, only preventDefault when input is enabled\n2. In `index.html`, add a `touchstart` handler that calls Navigation.handleClick\n\nWait, let me reconsider. The simplest and safest fix:\n\n**Approach**: Add touchstart/touchend event handling to the canvas in `index.html` that routes to Navigation when active. Don't rely on click events for mobile.\n\nHere's the plan:\n1. In `index.html`, add touch handlers alongside the click handler\n2. The touch handlers should handle Navigation clicks and the back-to-map button\n3. In `InputHandler.js`, make preventDefault conditional - only call it when processing a valid grid touch\n\nLet me implement this.\n\nActually, looking more carefully, the best fix is:\n\nIn `InputHandler.js`, modify the touch handlers to NOT call `preventDefault()` when the Navigation is active (i.e., when `this.enabled` is false and the game is on a nav screen).\n\nBut InputHandler doesn't know about Navigation state. However, `this.enabled` is set to `this.state === STATES.IDLE` in `Game.update()`. When Navigation is active, the game state is still IDLE (or whatever it was before), so `this.enabled` would still be true.\n\nWait, looking at the game loop in `Game.js`:\n```javascript\n_loop() {\n  ...\n  if (this.nav.isActive()) {\n    this.nav.render(this.renderer.ctx, this.renderer.screenW, this.renderer.screenH);\n    this.adManager.renderStubAd(this.renderer.ctx, this.renderer.screenW, this.renderer.screenH);\n    requestAnimationFrame(() => this._loop());\n    return;\n  }\n  this.update(dt);\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nWhen Navigation is active, `update()` is NOT called. So `input.enabled` stays at whatever it was last set to. If the user was in IDLE state before going to menu, `input.enabled` would be true.\n\nSo even when Navigation is active, `input.enabled` is true. This means InputHandler will still process touch events and call preventDefault, suppressing the click events that Navigation relies on.\n\nThe cleanest fix is:\n\n1. Add a method `InputHandler.setActive(active)` that enables/disables touch event processing\n2. Call `game.input.setActive(false)` when Navigation becomes active, and `game.input.setActive(true)` when returning to game\n3. When InputHandler is not active, don't call preventDefault\n\nOR, even simpler:\n\nIn `index.html`, add a `touchend` handler that routes to Navigation:\n\n```javascript\ncanvas.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {\n  if (game.nav.isActive()) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const t = e.changedTouches[0];\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const x = t.clientX - rect.left;\n    const y = t.clientY - rect.top;\n    const w = game.renderer.screenW;\n    const h = game.renderer.screenH;\n    game.adManager.handleStubClick(x, y, w, h);\n    game.nav.handleClick(x, y, w, h);\n    return;\n  }\n  // Back-to-map button in game\n  if (!game.nav.isActive()) {\n    const t = e.changedTouches[0];\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const x = t.clientX - rect.left;\n    const y = t.clientY - rect.top;\n    const w = game.renderer.screenW;\n    const backX = w - 50;\n    const backY = game.renderer.boardY + game.renderer.tileSize * BOARD_SIZE + 25;\n    if (x >= backX && x <= backX + 40 && y >= backY && y <= backY + 28) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      game.nav.goTo('map');\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\nBut this doesn't fix the issue that InputHandler's touchstart still calls preventDefault before our touchend handler runs.\n\nThe real fix needs to be in InputHandler. Let me modify it to skip preventDefault when Navigation is active:\n\n```javascript\nclass InputHandler {\n  constructor(canvas, board) {\n    ...\n    this.active = true; // New flag\n  }\n\n  setActive(active) {\n    this.active = active;\n  }\n\n  _bindEvents() {\n    // Mouse events\n    this.canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', e => this._onPointerDown(e.clientX, e.clientY));\n    this.canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', e => this._onPointerMove(e.clientX, e.clientY));\n    this.canvas.addEventListener('mouseup', e => this._onPointerUp(e.clientX, e.clientY));\n\n    // Touch events - only preventDefault when InputHandler is active\n    this.canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', e => {\n      if (!this.active) return;\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const t = e.touches[0];\n      this._onPointerDown(t.clientX, t.clientY);\n    }, { passive: false });\n\n    this.canvas.addEventListener('touchmove', e => {\n      if (!this.active) return;\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const t = e.touches[0];\n      this._onPointerMove(t.clientX, t.clientY);\n    }, { passive: false });\n\n    this.canvas.addEventListener('touchend', e => {\n      if (!this.active) return;\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const t = e.changedTouches[0];\n      this._onPointerUp(t.clientX, t.clientY);\n    }, { passive: false });\n  }\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nAnd in `Game.js`, update the Navigation state changes to toggle InputHandler:\n\n```javascript\n// In Navigation.goTo or wherever screen changes happen\ngoTo(screen) {\n  this.screen = screen;\n  this.game.input.active = (screen === NAV_SCREENS.GAME);\n}\n```\n\nWait, but `InputHandler` doesn't have access to `this.game`. Let me check Navigation.goTo again:\n\n```javascript\ngoTo(screen) {\n  this.screen = screen;\n}\n```\n\nI need to add input handler toggling to Navigation. Let me modify Navigation.goTo:\n\n```javascript\ngoTo(screen) {\n  this.screen = screen;\n  this.game.input.active = (screen === NAV_SCREENS.GAME);\n}\n```\n\nAnd in `index.html`, add touch event handling for Navigation:\n\n```javascript\ncanvas.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {\n  if (game.nav.isActive()) {\n    // Only handle if InputHandler didn't consume it\n    const t = e.changedTouches[0];\n    if (!t) return;\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const x = t.clientX - rect.left;\n    const y = t.clientY - rect.top;\n    const w = game.renderer.screenW;\n    const h = game.renderer.screenH;\n    \n    if (game.adManager.handleStubClick(x, y, w, h)) return;\n    game.nav.handleClick(x, y, w, h);\n  } else {\n    // Back-to-map button\n    const t = e.changedTouches[0];\n    if (!t) return;\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const x = t.clientX - rect.left;\n    const y = t.clientY - rect.top;\n    const w = game.renderer.screenW;\n    const backX = w - 50;\n    const backY = game.renderer.boardY + game.renderer.tileSize * BOARD_SIZE + 25;\n    if (x >= backX && x <= backX + 40 && y >= backY && y <= backY + 28) {\n      game.nav.goTo('map');\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\nWait, but the issue is that the touchend event for the canvas fires before our index.html handler AND the InputHandler handler. Event handlers fire in the order they were registered. InputHandler registers its touchend handler first (in constructor), then the index.html script registers the click handler. But the touchend handler in index.html would need to be registered separately.\n\nActually, I realize I need to think about this more carefully. The event listeners are registered in this order:\n1. `InputHandler._bindEvents()` registers touchstart/touchmove/touchend handlers\n2. The script in index.html registers a `click` handler\n\nWhen a touch happens:\n1. `touchstart` fires → InputHandler's handler runs → `preventDefault()` called\n2. `touchmove` fires (if any)\n3. `touchend` fires → InputHandler's handler runs → `preventDefault()` called\n4. Since `preventDefault()` was called on touchstart, NO click event is generated\n\nThe fix needs to prevent InputHandler from calling `preventDefault()` when Navigation is active. Let me go with my approach:\n\n1. Add `active` flag to InputHandler\n2. Toggle it from Navigation.goTo\n3. Add touchend handler in index.html for Navigation\n\nLet me implement all the fixes now. I'll also fix the other issues I found.\n\nFor the idiom game, the fixes are:\n1. Add `touch-action: manipulation` to body CSS\n2. Fix search input with proper attributes\n3. Replace `confirm()` with custom modal (or just remove confirm for mobile)\n\nActually, for the idiom game, since it uses DOM elements with onclick handlers, the touch handling is actually fine. Modern mobile browsers convert touch events to click events automatically when there's no touchstart handler with preventDefault. The `user-scalable=no` viewport meta prevents double-tap zoom delay.\n\nSo the main issues for the idiom game are:\n1. Missing `touch-action: manipulation` on body\n2. `confirm()` dialogs may not work on Douyin\n3. Search input optimization\n4. Scroll performance\n\nLet me now implement the fixes and write the tests.\n\nLet me also check the MapScreen and ShopUI for the match-3 game to see if they have similar touch issues.\n\nActually, since all Navigation screens use `handleClick()` which is called from the `click` event in index.html, ALL navigation screens are broken on touch. The fix I'm implementing will fix all of them.\n\nLet me also check the `Back-to-map` button which uses the same click handler.\n\nOK, let me now implement all the fixes. I'll start with the match-3 game.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the approach. The simplest fix that minimizes changes:\n\n**Option 1: Modify InputHandler to not intercept touches when nav is active**\n\nChange InputHandler touch handlers to check `this.active`:\n- Pro: Clean separation\n- Con: Need to add active flag and toggle it\n\n**Option 2: Add touch handler in index.html alongside click handler**\n\nAdd a `touchend` handler in index.html that routes to Navigation:\n- Pro: No changes to existing classes\n- Con: Still has preventDefault issue from InputHandler\n\n**Option 3: Use pointer events instead of separate touch/mouse**\n\nReplace all touch/mouse events with pointer events:\n- Pro: Modern approach, simpler code\n- Con: Larger change, pointer events might not be supported in all Douyin mini-game runtimes\n\nI'll go with Option 1 since it's the cleanest fix. Let me implement it.\n\nLet me now write the fixes:\n\n### Fix 1: InputHandler.js - Add active flag\n\n### Fix 2: Navigation.js - Toggle input handler active state\n\n### Fix 3: index.html - Add touchend handler for Navigation\n\n### Fix 4: Idiom game - CSS touch-action\n\n### Fix 5: Idiom game - Search input\n\nLet me implement these now.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33562fd9-d4f0-45be-a2a4-d9d379182d9f","uuid":"578ec2c9-b2b0-467a-afaf-28dee7556bf0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026052318182825eecd44a6624680","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我已经识别出两款游戏中的关键问题。现在我将着手修复它们。\n\n**发现的关键 Bug（match-3 游戏）：** `InputHandler.js` 在所有 touch 事件上调用了 `preventDefault()`，这完全抑制了 `click` 事件的触发。这意味着所有的 Navigation 页面（菜单、地图、商店、角色选择、结果）在触摸设备上都无法使用。\n\n**发现的 Idiom 游戏问题：** 缺少 `touch-action` CSS 属性，在可能不支持 `confirm()` 对话框的平台上使用了该对话框，搜索输入框未针对移动端进行优化，滚动列表渲染缓慢。\n\n我将着手修复所有问题。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33562fd9-d4f0-45be-a2a4-d9d379182d9f","uuid":"e7e124e5-a40a-449d-af01-5d9013840023"}
